ler must have a balance of at least `amount`."},"transferFrom(address,address,uint256)":{"details":"See {IERC20-transferFrom}. Emits an {Approval} event indicating the updated allowance. This is not required by the EIP. See the note at the beginning of {ERC20}. NOTE: Does not update the allowance if the current allowance is the maximum `uint256`. Requirements: - `from` and `to` cannot be the zero address. - `from` must have a balance of at least `amount`. - the caller must have allowance for ``from``'s tokens of at least `amount`."},"withdrawFromDolomiteMargin(uint256,uint256)":{"params":{"_amountWei":"The amount of tokens to withdraw","_fromAccountNumber":"The account number of the account from which the tokens will be withdrawn"}}},"title":"PlutusVaultGLPWrappedTokenUserVaultFactory","version":1},"userdoc":{"kind":"user","methods":{"calculateVaultByAccount(address)":{"notice":"Same as `getVaultByAccount`, but always returns the user's non-zero vault address."},"createVault(address)":{"notice":"Creates the vault for `_account`"},"createVaultAndDepositIntoDolomiteMargin(uint256,uint256)":{"notice":"Creates the vault for `msg.sender`"},"depositIntoDolomiteMargin(uint256,uint256)":{"notice":"This function should only be called by a user's vault contract"},"enqueueTransferFromDolomiteMargin(address,uint256)":{"notice":"Enqueues a transfer from Dolomite Margin to the token converter. Assumes msg.sender is a trusted token          converter, else reverts. Reverts if `_vault` is not a valid vault contract."},"enqueueTransferIntoDolomiteMargin(address,uint256)":{"notice":"Enqueues a transfer into Dolomite Margin from the vault. Assumes msg.sender is a trusted token          converter, else reverts. Reverts if `_vault` is not a valid vault contract."},"isTokenConverterTrusted(address)":{"notice":"A token converter is used to convert this underlying token into a Dolomite-compatible one for deposit          or withdrawal"},"ownerInitialize(address[])":{"notice":"Initializes t